1. to the caller: $user / top level: $setx x=$x
2. global, from deep: $deep g=$g
3. to a named calling macro: $a / not calling, skipped: y=[$y]
4. no value: $pass n=$n flag=$flag
5. a computed value: $sum<q=7> total=$total
6. removed in between: $outer then x=$x
7. builtins do not count as callers: $loop
8. a config param: $cfg $range<0, 3>
9. := inherits an export: $inh $setk $inh
10. a call in the output sees the export: $emit($show_z)
